1
00:00:00,251 --> 00:00:01,544
It is hereby declared

2
00:00:01,544 --> 00:00:05,756
that the new president
is Mr. Ricardo Salvador!

3
00:00:05,756 --> 00:00:07,550
Nothing's fair
about what's happening here.

4
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:08,801
I won't make your life easy.

5
00:00:08,801 --> 00:00:12,012
No matter how much you try
to bury the truth,

6
00:00:12,012 --> 00:00:13,597
no secret remains hidden
forever.

7
00:00:13,597 --> 00:00:17,560
How dare you bring
your ex-wife into our home!

8
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:19,770
Don't you have a shred
of decency left?!

9
00:00:19,770 --> 00:00:21,897
How does Patricia know
I'm your ex-wife?

10
00:00:21,897 --> 00:00:23,399
Diana was the only one
who knew about that.

11
00:00:23,399 --> 00:00:25,484
Patricia can't make it
to the summit.

12
00:00:25,484 --> 00:00:27,528
Do whatever it takes
to stop her from getting there.

13
00:00:27,528 --> 00:00:28,946
I looked for that bakeshop.

14
00:00:28,946 --> 00:00:31,949
I have a strong feeling
Sir Teddy is nearby.

15
00:00:31,949 --> 00:00:34,201
We have to get there now.

16
00:00:34,201 --> 00:00:36,871
Ricardo Salvador
was officially named

17
00:00:36,871 --> 00:00:39,415
the new CEO of La Familia.

18
00:00:44,253 --> 00:00:45,588
Miss.

19
00:00:45,588 --> 00:00:46,839
Miss, can I borrow your phone?

20
00:00:46,839 --> 00:00:49,425
Please, I just have
an emergency. Please!

21
00:00:53,554 --> 00:00:55,222
Miss, may I use your phone?

22
00:00:55,222 --> 00:00:57,057
I'm begging you, please!
I need to call someone.

23
00:00:57,057 --> 00:00:58,601
- Sir, there's a car coming!
- Sir, there's a car!

24
00:00:58,601 --> 00:01:00,227
Please, I--

25
00:02:22,810 --> 00:02:23,811
- Ow!
- Uh-oh.

26
00:02:23,811 --> 00:02:25,062
I'm so sorry.

27
00:02:25,062 --> 00:02:26,230
I'm sorry, ma'am.

28
00:02:33,737 --> 00:02:36,198
Watch where you're going.

29
00:02:36,198 --> 00:02:37,283
I'm sorry.

30
00:03:21,118 --> 00:03:22,244
Hello, Oliver?

31
00:03:22,244 --> 00:03:23,370
How are things going?

32
00:03:23,370 --> 00:03:25,164
I'm done with the plan, bestie.

33
00:03:25,164 --> 00:03:26,165
Success.

34
00:03:29,877 --> 00:03:34,798
I don't agree with changing
Cala Soda.

35
00:03:34,798 --> 00:03:36,884
But you voted in favor of it.

36
00:03:36,884 --> 00:03:41,221
I only did it because I know
Patricia wouldn't like it.

37
00:03:42,431 --> 00:03:45,809
Carlota, this conversation
is going nowhere.

38
00:03:45,809 --> 00:03:50,481
La Familia's profits mainly come
from Cala Soda.

39
00:03:50,481 --> 00:03:53,859
That's why it was acquired
by Burger City, right?

40
00:03:53,859 --> 00:03:57,029
The people might not like
the new taste!

41
00:03:57,029 --> 00:03:59,448
Do you think I don't know
what I'm doing?

42
00:03:59,448 --> 00:04:01,450
My point is that
my husband and I

43
00:04:01,450 --> 00:04:04,453
invested a lot of money
here in La Familia.

44
00:04:04,453 --> 00:04:05,913
I don't want it to go to waste!

45
00:04:05,913 --> 00:04:07,998
I'm just getting started!

46
00:04:07,998 --> 00:04:10,501
Just trust me.

47
00:04:19,593 --> 00:04:20,803
Hello, Patricia?

48
00:04:20,803 --> 00:04:22,471
Let's push through
with the plan, Oliver.

49
00:04:23,555 --> 00:04:25,391
Don't worry, bestie.

50
00:04:25,391 --> 00:04:26,725
I've already started.

51
00:05:05,973 --> 00:05:08,642
What do you really
intend to do with La Familia?

52
00:05:10,019 --> 00:05:12,187
I want for the truth to come out

53
00:05:13,188 --> 00:05:16,150
and their sins revealed.

54
00:05:16,150 --> 00:05:17,943
This is a huge problem.

55
00:05:17,943 --> 00:05:20,195
My gut tells me that the old man

56
00:05:20,195 --> 00:05:21,530
- already knows something!
- How dare you!

57
00:05:21,530 --> 00:05:23,407
Huh?!

58
00:05:23,407 --> 00:05:24,825
You know, you've become paranoid

59
00:05:24,825 --> 00:05:26,744
- because you drank too much!
- No, I'm not drunk!

60
00:05:26,744 --> 00:05:30,205
Do you think we can get past
that old man?

61
00:05:30,205 --> 00:05:32,666
They might even take
my daughter from me.

62
00:05:32,666 --> 00:05:35,127
He could easily destroy us.

63
00:05:35,127 --> 00:05:37,588
He'll ruin our lives!

64
00:05:37,588 --> 00:05:39,381
I won't let him.

65
00:05:43,385 --> 00:05:46,430
Why aren't you working?!

66
00:05:48,724 --> 00:05:50,893
- Oh?
- Don Lucio.

67
00:05:50,893 --> 00:05:54,146
Uh, what are you doing here?
Why aren't you at the party?

68
00:05:54,146 --> 00:05:57,608
Um, I was just going to give
my husband his dinner.

69
00:05:57,608 --> 00:05:58,859
He's still on his shift.

70
00:05:58,859 --> 00:06:00,402
Is Enzo having a good time?

71
00:06:00,402 --> 00:06:02,446
Certainly, sir!

72
00:06:04,615 --> 00:06:06,366
What on earth are you doing?!

73
00:06:06,366 --> 00:06:07,409
Shh!

74
00:06:07,409 --> 00:06:08,619
What is all this?!

75
00:06:09,745 --> 00:06:12,289
We need to get rid
of all the evidence!

76
00:06:12,289 --> 00:06:16,210
All of the proof that we stole
money from the company!

77
00:06:16,210 --> 00:06:18,837
I thought you said
it was clean?!

78
00:06:18,837 --> 00:06:21,340
That no one will know
that we did something!

79
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:23,717
That's why I tried
to find a way, didn't I?

80
00:06:23,717 --> 00:06:26,929
Not to mention I called you
for you to cause a scene!

81
00:06:26,929 --> 00:06:29,473
Are we just going to let them
find an evidence

82
00:06:29,473 --> 00:06:30,557
against us? Huh?

83
00:06:30,557 --> 00:06:31,809
Screw you, Carlota!

84
00:06:31,809 --> 00:06:33,352
Good Lord!

85
00:06:33,352 --> 00:06:34,937
I trusted you!

86
00:06:37,481 --> 00:06:38,774
Ugh!

87
00:06:38,774 --> 00:06:41,276
I can't get it to work!
What do I do?

88
00:06:47,699 --> 00:06:49,326
Are you not going to go back?

89
00:06:49,326 --> 00:06:53,747
Um, I'll just go
get some fresh air first.

90
00:06:53,747 --> 00:06:55,207
I'll go back after.

91
00:06:55,207 --> 00:06:57,751
- I'll get going then, sir.
- Sure.

92
00:06:57,751 --> 00:06:58,919
See you around.

93
00:07:09,763 --> 00:07:11,431
Carlota, wait!

94
00:07:11,431 --> 00:07:13,350
Wait a second, hey!

95
00:07:13,350 --> 00:07:14,893
Hey, you two!

96
00:07:15,811 --> 00:07:17,563
Do you intend to kill me, huh?!

97
00:07:17,563 --> 00:07:19,773
Hey, come here. Come here, you!

98
00:07:19,773 --> 00:07:21,525
Ah! Let go of me!

99
00:07:21,525 --> 00:07:23,235
- Let go of her!
- Unhand me!

100
00:07:23,235 --> 00:07:24,820
- Get over here!
- Let me go!

101
00:07:24,820 --> 00:07:26,363
Come here!

102
00:07:30,617 --> 00:07:31,994
Hey!

103
00:07:31,994 --> 00:07:33,871
How dare you!

104
00:07:33,871 --> 00:07:36,331
You witch!

105
00:07:36,331 --> 00:07:38,876
- No!
- You wench!

106
00:07:38,876 --> 00:07:41,170
Prepare yourself
to get behind bars

107
00:07:41,170 --> 00:07:45,382
because I don't let anything
slide past me!

108
00:07:45,382 --> 00:07:47,176
I won't let you!

109
00:07:47,176 --> 00:07:49,469
Let go of me!

110
00:08:08,030 --> 00:08:09,031
Help.

111
00:08:10,991 --> 00:08:12,034
Help!

112
00:08:44,024 --> 00:08:46,777
How'd it go?
Did you find Uncle Teddy?

113
00:08:46,777 --> 00:08:49,404
We did. But he managed
to escape.

114
00:08:51,114 --> 00:08:54,034
Georgia, have you tried
calling your home?

115
00:08:54,034 --> 00:08:56,828
Yes, but he wasn't there.

116
00:08:56,828 --> 00:08:59,915
I already called everywhere
he could possibly go.

117
00:08:59,915 --> 00:09:01,333
But he's not in any of them.

118
00:09:04,628 --> 00:09:06,380
Why did you call?

119
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:08,715
Ma'am, we have a problem.

120
00:09:08,715 --> 00:09:10,259
Teddy escaped!

121
00:09:14,888 --> 00:09:16,723
Ricardo, pick up...

122
00:09:16,723 --> 00:09:18,100
Pick up, Ricardo...

123
00:09:24,231 --> 00:09:26,483
Ma'am, does this
plate number belong to your car?

124
00:09:26,483 --> 00:09:28,151
It's Ricardo's. Why?
What happened?

125
00:09:28,151 --> 00:09:31,321
It got hit by a guest's car.

126
00:09:31,321 --> 00:09:32,823
We're still looking for him!

127
00:09:32,823 --> 00:09:34,741
The guest wants to talk to him.

128
00:09:34,741 --> 00:09:37,452
Tell that guest that we'll
get back to them!

129
00:09:37,452 --> 00:09:38,912
Inform the guests

130
00:09:38,912 --> 00:09:40,205
that there's a commotion
at the ramp,

131
00:09:40,205 --> 00:09:41,790
don't let anyone through
for now.

132
00:09:41,790 --> 00:09:42,874
Copy that!

133
00:09:42,874 --> 00:09:44,626
I'm sorry, ma'am,
but this area is off limits.

134
00:09:44,626 --> 00:09:46,336
It's not safe. There's a fight!

135
00:09:46,336 --> 00:09:47,671
I'm sorry, ma'am!

136
00:09:47,671 --> 00:09:49,715
Alright then.
I'll use the back door!

137
00:09:52,801 --> 00:09:54,469
Ah!

138
00:09:54,469 --> 00:09:55,637
What are you doing?!

139
00:09:55,637 --> 00:09:58,390
You're not looking
where you're going!

140
00:09:58,390 --> 00:09:59,433
I'm sorry, ma'am!
I didn't mean it!

141
00:09:59,433 --> 00:10:00,684
What if I get hurt?!

142
00:10:00,684 --> 00:10:01,727
- Sorry, ma'am!
- Stay away from me!

143
00:10:01,727 --> 00:10:04,521
Where's your manager?!

144
00:10:05,230 --> 00:10:06,565
What's going on here?

145
00:10:06,565 --> 00:10:08,233
- Sir...
- Your waiter!

146
00:10:08,233 --> 00:10:11,486
I want that stupid waiter fired!

147
00:10:11,486 --> 00:10:12,988
I'm sorry, ma'am. I'm sorry.

148
00:10:12,988 --> 00:10:14,531
But I saw what happened.

149
00:10:14,531 --> 00:10:15,866
It was her fault.

150
00:10:15,866 --> 00:10:19,036
If she didn't push him,
he wouldn't have dropped it!

151
00:10:19,036 --> 00:10:21,038
- What?
- Ma'am.

152
00:10:21,038 --> 00:10:21,955
Uh...

153
00:10:21,955 --> 00:10:23,874
Are you ganging up on me?

154
00:10:23,874 --> 00:10:26,376
Ma'am, we're not!
It was an accident!

155
00:10:26,376 --> 00:10:27,502
You'll see what's coming to you!

156
00:10:27,502 --> 00:10:28,795
I saw it all, ma'am.

157
00:10:28,795 --> 00:10:30,547
- Be ready.
- Don't be like that.

158
00:10:30,547 --> 00:10:31,757
I'm sorry, ma'am.

159
00:10:36,219 --> 00:10:37,888
Make sure that woman
will be stopped.

160
00:10:37,888 --> 00:10:38,972
I'll take care of it.

161
00:10:38,972 --> 00:10:41,933
You've got a lot more to do.
Go on now!

162
00:10:43,894 --> 00:10:46,480
Major changes
are being expected

163
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:48,732
from La Familia Bottling Company

164
00:10:48,732 --> 00:10:52,110
with the appointment
of Ricardo Salvador,

165
00:10:52,110 --> 00:10:55,030
the husband of the late
Diana Aragon, as the CEO.

166
00:10:55,030 --> 00:10:57,908
At the same time,
new members were added

167
00:10:57,908 --> 00:10:59,659
to the company's
board of directors.

168
00:11:00,327 --> 00:11:03,288
Meanwhile, the board
and shareholders

169
00:11:03,288 --> 00:11:06,958
of La Familia Bottling Company
for the Shareholder's Summit

170
00:11:06,958 --> 00:11:08,460
to talk about the direction

171
00:11:08,460 --> 00:11:10,629
in which they would
take the company

172
00:11:10,629 --> 00:11:15,634
following the tragic death
of its former CEO, Diana Aragon.

173
00:11:16,426 --> 00:11:17,969
Th-that woman...

174
00:11:17,969 --> 00:11:19,888
She shouldn't be there!

175
00:11:20,972 --> 00:11:22,891
Call P-Patricia!

176
00:11:22,891 --> 00:11:24,226
Ca-call her! Quick!

177
00:11:24,226 --> 00:11:25,685
- Yes, Pa.
- Hurry up!

178
00:11:25,685 --> 00:11:26,895
I'll call her!

179
00:11:29,981 --> 00:11:35,112
Don't tell
anyone about this.

180
00:12:31,877 --> 00:12:33,086
Diana?

181
00:12:33,086 --> 00:12:34,129
Diana!

182
00:12:35,130 --> 00:12:36,298
Diana!

183
00:12:47,726 --> 00:12:50,645
Sir Nestor? What happened?

184
00:12:50,645 --> 00:12:54,107
Patricia, you need
to know something.

185
00:12:57,235 --> 00:12:58,445
Who is she?

186
00:12:59,070 --> 00:13:00,405
Patricia.

187
00:13:01,031 --> 00:13:02,407
I'm Emmy.

188
00:13:03,033 --> 00:13:06,244
We didn't get to know
each other.

189
00:13:06,244 --> 00:13:09,206
You were just a kid when I
worked for your grandfather

190
00:13:09,206 --> 00:13:10,540
in La Familia.

191
00:13:13,126 --> 00:13:15,128
What are you doing here?

192
00:13:15,128 --> 00:13:17,672
Do you know why
Carlota is in La Familia

193
00:13:17,672 --> 00:13:19,466
and what she's doing there?

194
00:13:19,466 --> 00:13:20,926
A lot has happened.

195
00:13:22,219 --> 00:13:23,595
But now,

196
00:13:23,595 --> 00:13:27,098
she became a shareholder
together with her new husband.

197
00:13:27,098 --> 00:13:29,851
She shouldn't be
in La Familia!

198
00:13:29,851 --> 00:13:32,062
After all that she did.

199
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:34,940
What do you mean?

200
00:13:35,941 --> 00:13:37,901
A lot of people are getting hurt
because of what happened

201
00:13:37,901 --> 00:13:39,736
to La Familia.

202
00:13:39,736 --> 00:13:43,114
We are doing everything
we can to save the company.

203
00:13:43,114 --> 00:13:46,326
If you know anything,
please tell me.

204
00:13:52,374 --> 00:13:54,626
Before your grandfather died,

205
00:13:54,626 --> 00:13:58,630
we learned that Carlota
was stealing from the company

206
00:13:58,630 --> 00:13:59,923
together with Cecilia

207
00:14:01,049 --> 00:14:02,092
and...

208
00:14:04,094 --> 00:14:06,137
Martin, your father.

209
00:14:10,559 --> 00:14:11,935
Papa?

210
00:14:14,354 --> 00:14:17,857
Sir, the results of the
preliminary investigation

211
00:14:17,857 --> 00:14:20,610
have been released.

212
00:14:20,610 --> 00:14:22,028
Uh...

213
00:14:22,028 --> 00:14:24,906
They are the ones found
stealing from La Familia.

214
00:14:25,824 --> 00:14:30,996
But we need a stronger evidence
to make a case.

215
00:14:30,996 --> 00:14:33,206
Are you going to suspend them

216
00:14:33,206 --> 00:14:35,709
while the investigation
is ongoing?

217
00:14:35,709 --> 00:14:40,130
Don't tell anyone about this.

218
00:14:42,382 --> 00:14:44,509
No one should know about this.

219
00:14:44,509 --> 00:14:45,677
Sir?

220
00:14:46,553 --> 00:14:47,721
I'll handle this.

221
00:14:49,472 --> 00:14:52,559
Diana will definitely
get affected again.

222
00:15:01,026 --> 00:15:02,611
You could be wrong.

223
00:15:02,611 --> 00:15:04,821
Papa wouldn't do that.

224
00:15:04,821 --> 00:15:06,156
He wanted to

225
00:15:06,156 --> 00:15:10,201
meet with Martin and
Carlota before telling Diana.

226
00:15:10,201 --> 00:15:12,370
He knew your family
would be affected.

227
00:15:20,837 --> 00:15:25,550
Th-this can't be!

228
00:15:25,550 --> 00:15:26,801
Patricia...

229
00:15:28,219 --> 00:15:29,846
I'm telling the truth.

230
00:15:33,266 --> 00:15:35,518
Do you have any proof
for what you are saying?

231
00:15:35,518 --> 00:15:38,229
Everything was
destroyed in the fire.

232
00:15:41,316 --> 00:15:43,735
Papa!

233
00:15:51,284 --> 00:15:54,329
What was grandpa doing in the
factory when the fire happened?

234
00:16:08,927 --> 00:16:12,263
We're getting there.
We're getting there.

235
00:16:12,263 --> 00:16:13,848
Oh! Good heavens!

236
00:16:20,188 --> 00:16:22,190
- Sir.
- Where's Patricia?

237
00:16:22,190 --> 00:16:25,110
Get me Patricia! She did this!

238
00:16:25,110 --> 00:16:26,361
Patricia!

239
00:16:30,115 --> 00:16:32,534
What we did has a big impact
on Patricia's fight.

240
00:16:32,534 --> 00:16:34,536
- Of course!
- Where's Diana?!

241
00:16:34,536 --> 00:16:36,788
I saw Diana!

242
00:16:36,788 --> 00:16:38,289
Diana!

243
00:16:38,289 --> 00:16:42,502
Ricardo, Patricia's not here.

244
00:16:42,502 --> 00:16:45,255
She wasn't able to attend
the summit, right?

245
00:16:46,798 --> 00:16:48,466
Ricardo.

246
00:16:48,466 --> 00:16:51,094
Everyone is looking at you.
Come on.

247
00:16:51,094 --> 00:16:52,512
Let's go inside.

248
00:17:00,687 --> 00:17:01,813
Come on.

249
00:17:11,489 --> 00:17:13,825
Why is he looking for Miss D?

250
00:17:13,825 --> 00:17:16,411
Our director is really good!
What a success!

251
00:17:19,205 --> 00:17:21,124
Are you sure he's asleep?

252
00:17:21,124 --> 00:17:22,709
Yes. He's knocked out.

253
00:17:22,709 --> 00:17:24,043
What about the blood
and the knife?

254
00:17:24,043 --> 00:17:25,503
Here.

255
00:17:25,503 --> 00:17:27,797
Here, here.

256
00:17:27,797 --> 00:17:29,549
- Sorry, sorry.
- There you go.

257
00:17:33,052 --> 00:17:34,220
There.

258
00:17:45,315 --> 00:17:46,399
Thank you, guys.

259
00:17:46,399 --> 00:17:50,487
- It's nothing!
- Anything for Patricia.

260
00:17:50,487 --> 00:17:52,822
The acting workshops
we took before paid off.

261
00:17:56,659 --> 00:17:58,411
Oh, dear.

262
00:17:58,411 --> 00:17:59,788
You're home late.

263
00:18:01,539 --> 00:18:03,750
You should eat first.

264
00:18:03,750 --> 00:18:08,046
I cooked earlier. This...

265
00:18:08,046 --> 00:18:12,884
We have vegetables and fish.
Eat now.

266
00:18:16,846 --> 00:18:19,224
Why? Did something happen?

267
00:18:21,935 --> 00:18:24,062
Tell me the truth, Pa.

268
00:18:25,647 --> 00:18:27,899
I want it to come from you.

269
00:18:30,902 --> 00:18:32,153
What is it?

270
00:18:35,365 --> 00:18:37,784
Is it true that you
and Mama Carlota

271
00:18:37,784 --> 00:18:39,661
stole money from
La Familia before?

272
00:18:41,412 --> 00:18:43,373
Pa, tell me.

273
00:18:45,834 --> 00:18:47,210
Is it true?

274
00:18:49,462 --> 00:18:53,967
You, Mama Carlota, and
Cecilia Pineda stole money?

275
00:18:56,970 --> 00:18:59,013
They are toying with me.

276
00:19:01,474 --> 00:19:02,642
Calm down first.

277
00:19:04,102 --> 00:19:07,230
Before the shareholders
think anything worse!

278
00:19:09,440 --> 00:19:12,277
What the hell
are you talking about?

279
00:19:12,277 --> 00:19:14,153
Diana is dead!

280
00:19:16,531 --> 00:19:18,908
You need to calm down because...

281
00:19:18,908 --> 00:19:21,828
Because we have
another problem.

282
00:19:25,373 --> 00:19:27,000
What is it?

283
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:28,418
Teddy escaped.

284
00:19:29,961 --> 00:19:32,589
Ah! Ricardo!

285
00:19:32,589 --> 00:19:34,048
- Ricardo!
- What?!

286
00:19:34,048 --> 00:19:35,717
You're hurting me, Ricardo!

287
00:20:09,834 --> 00:20:12,754
The CCTV I put up
in the mansion.

288
00:20:12,754 --> 00:20:15,048
I'm sure they found out
about everything...

289
00:20:15,715 --> 00:20:17,842
and what I did to Diana.

290
00:20:22,805 --> 00:20:23,806
Argh!

291
00:20:31,648 --> 00:20:34,609
No one knows the real cause
of Diana's death, right?

292
00:20:36,569 --> 00:20:38,529
Patricia is coming after me.

293
00:20:40,323 --> 00:20:42,575
How did they find out
everything if...

294
00:20:43,618 --> 00:20:45,119
if Diana is dead?

295
00:20:55,630 --> 00:20:57,340
How could you do that?

296
00:21:01,594 --> 00:21:05,181
Why did you steal
from Grandpa and Mama?

297
00:21:05,181 --> 00:21:08,518
Explain it to me.
I don't understand!

298
00:21:10,228 --> 00:21:12,105
Dear, please forgive me.

299
00:21:14,857 --> 00:21:17,819
I held a deep grudge against
your grandfather back then

300
00:21:18,111 --> 00:21:22,782
because he never accepted me
as your mother's husband.

301
00:21:23,658 --> 00:21:25,118
Please forgive me.

302
00:21:26,411 --> 00:21:30,248
Cecilia Pineda and Grandpa
were together

303
00:21:30,248 --> 00:21:32,208
at the factory
when the fire broke out.

304
00:21:34,043 --> 00:21:35,878
What were they doing there?

305
00:21:37,922 --> 00:21:41,509
Did Cecilia Pineda
set the factory on fire?

306
00:21:42,218 --> 00:21:43,511
I don't know.

307
00:21:44,345 --> 00:21:45,346
I don't know.

308
00:21:53,146 --> 00:21:54,731
Did you and Mama Carlota

309
00:21:54,731 --> 00:21:57,025
have anything to do
with the fire?

310
00:21:57,984 --> 00:21:58,943
No.

311
00:22:00,028 --> 00:22:01,029
Dear...

312
00:22:01,029 --> 00:22:02,488
I had nothing to do with it!

313
00:22:02,488 --> 00:22:05,033
Then, explain it to me!

314
00:22:05,616 --> 00:22:07,577
What happened?!

315
00:22:08,202 --> 00:22:09,871
My god.

316
00:22:09,871 --> 00:22:14,417
That fire was the root
of all this!

317
00:22:21,799 --> 00:22:22,884
Dear...

318
00:22:23,342 --> 00:22:24,802
Dear.

319
00:22:25,970 --> 00:22:29,891
I've never asked you
for anything, Pa.

320
00:22:32,101 --> 00:22:36,814
But we both know
how my life was ruined

321
00:22:36,814 --> 00:22:38,941
because of what happened
back then.

322
00:22:40,985 --> 00:22:42,403
Please.

323
00:22:42,403 --> 00:22:45,448
All I'm asking for is the truth.

324
00:22:52,997 --> 00:22:54,540
I know

325
00:22:55,208 --> 00:22:58,252
you've made so many mistakes.

326
00:23:00,755 --> 00:23:03,007
But I still want to believe

327
00:23:04,425 --> 00:23:09,013
that you want to fix
the mistakes you've made.

328
00:23:10,223 --> 00:23:11,599
Dear.

329
00:23:11,599 --> 00:23:12,642
Dear.

330
00:23:14,352 --> 00:23:15,394
Dear!

331
00:23:32,036 --> 00:23:34,705
These are the test results
for Diana's ashes.

332
00:23:37,208 --> 00:23:38,751
They're not human ashes.

333
00:23:40,086 --> 00:23:41,546
It's not her.

334
00:24:00,773 --> 00:24:03,234
What happened to the
investigator I talked to before?

335
00:24:04,193 --> 00:24:06,154
The one who investigated
Diana's body.

336
00:24:06,404 --> 00:24:07,864
I had someone track him down.

337
00:24:08,573 --> 00:24:11,534
But no police officer matched
the name you provided.

338
00:24:12,160 --> 00:24:15,204
Looks like this was part
of their little scheme.

339
00:24:15,204 --> 00:24:17,999
Patricia can't find out
that I know the truth.

340
00:24:19,083 --> 00:24:20,835
Diana needs to show herself.

341
00:24:23,254 --> 00:24:25,214
Any news on finding Teddy?

342
00:24:25,965 --> 00:24:27,758
Our people are looking
for him now.

343
00:24:28,259 --> 00:24:30,469
What if Patricia finds him?!

344
00:24:30,469 --> 00:24:31,596
Relax!

345
00:24:31,596 --> 00:24:32,555
Relax.

346
00:24:33,848 --> 00:24:36,559
If they really found him,

347
00:24:36,559 --> 00:24:38,227
why haven't we been arrested?

348
00:24:38,895 --> 00:24:40,354
Carlota is the one
you should be worried about

349
00:24:40,354 --> 00:24:42,356
because she's the most cunning
of them all.

350
00:24:43,107 --> 00:24:46,068
Her husband seems set
on buying the company.

351
00:24:46,319 --> 00:24:48,821
Looks like they're planning
a takeover.

352
00:24:53,242 --> 00:24:55,411
Sir.
You wanted to see me?

353
00:24:59,415 --> 00:25:01,375
Where was Patricia
during the summit?

354
00:25:01,375 --> 00:25:02,668
We were at the hospital.

355
00:25:02,668 --> 00:25:03,961
Like I told you.

356
00:25:03,961 --> 00:25:06,756
I took her home afterward,
and we were together all day.

357
00:25:06,756 --> 00:25:09,300
Looks like Patricia
is the most cunning of them all.

358
00:25:10,009 --> 00:25:12,053
Even from far away,
she can still get things done.

359
00:25:14,138 --> 00:25:16,098
I'll put an end to all of this.

360
00:25:17,808 --> 00:25:19,810
Patricia won't be able
to do anything.

361
00:25:21,646 --> 00:25:24,148
Neither will any ghost
that tries to stop me.

362
00:25:26,776 --> 00:25:27,902
Please make sure everything
is ready

363
00:25:27,902 --> 00:25:29,779
for the town hall later, okay?

364
00:25:29,779 --> 00:25:30,947
Okay, ma'am.

365
00:25:30,947 --> 00:25:32,198
Town hall?

366
00:25:32,198 --> 00:25:33,950
Why not just do it face-to-face?

367
00:25:33,950 --> 00:25:35,284
Beats me.

368
00:25:35,284 --> 00:25:36,619
It's Patricia.

369
00:25:36,619 --> 00:25:38,079
Oh, Patricia.

370
00:25:38,120 --> 00:25:39,455
What are you doing here?

371
00:25:41,207 --> 00:25:43,167
I heard Ricardo
has a big announcement.

372
00:25:43,501 --> 00:25:45,419
I'm here to see what it's about.

373
00:25:45,419 --> 00:25:46,379
Yeah.

374
00:25:46,379 --> 00:25:48,172
Word is spreading fast.

375
00:25:48,506 --> 00:25:50,549
They're saying people
are going to be laid off.

376
00:25:51,217 --> 00:25:52,718
Patricia, did you know
about this?

377
00:25:53,636 --> 00:25:56,138
I'm not going
to let that happen.

378
00:25:58,224 --> 00:25:59,392
Patricia.

379
00:26:08,651 --> 00:26:11,112
As if there's anything
you can do.

380
00:26:11,487 --> 00:26:12,989
That's what you always do.

381
00:26:13,614 --> 00:26:15,241
I expected this from you.

382
00:26:15,700 --> 00:26:17,743
That you would hurt
Mama and me.

383
00:26:18,703 --> 00:26:20,162
What are you talking about?

384
00:26:20,705 --> 00:26:22,498
You can't fool me anymore.

385
00:26:23,582 --> 00:26:25,668
Even back then,
you sided with those

386
00:26:25,668 --> 00:26:28,129
who wanted to bring
La Familia down.

387
00:26:28,421 --> 00:26:32,425
Why would I want La Familia
to fail?

388
00:26:33,592 --> 00:26:40,599
I want this company to succeed
and last for many, many years.

389
00:26:43,728 --> 00:26:46,689
But I want to be the owner.

390
00:26:51,569 --> 00:26:53,571
I'll do whatever it takes

391
00:26:54,405 --> 00:26:57,908
to take all of this away
from you.

392
00:26:58,451 --> 00:27:01,954
I'll make sure
that never happens.

393
00:27:02,580 --> 00:27:06,584
Everything you've done
will come to light.

394
00:27:07,877 --> 00:27:08,919
Mama.

395
00:27:17,762 --> 00:27:18,971
Mr. Smith, can we talk?

396
00:27:18,971 --> 00:27:20,514
Sorry.
Look, I'm busy.

397
00:27:20,514 --> 00:27:22,058
- I have to go.
- Please, I only need a minute.

398
00:27:22,058 --> 00:27:23,184
It's about your wife.

399
00:27:23,809 --> 00:27:24,769
Look.

400
00:27:24,769 --> 00:27:26,270
If it's a problem
between you two,

401
00:27:26,270 --> 00:27:28,272
I do not want to get involved.

402
00:27:28,689 --> 00:27:30,900
And I'm telling you,
Ms. Dela Cruz,

403
00:27:30,900 --> 00:27:33,486
I'm going to protect
my wife's interests.

404
00:27:33,486 --> 00:27:35,946
I need to tell you
something about her.

405
00:27:35,946 --> 00:27:36,947
Please.

406
00:27:46,165 --> 00:27:47,666
Sir, can you hear me?

407
00:27:52,588 --> 00:27:53,631
Sir?

408
00:27:54,173 --> 00:27:55,883
Can you hear me, sir?

409
00:28:06,018 --> 00:28:08,145
Sir, let's put it back on.

410
00:28:11,273 --> 00:28:12,274
Georgia.

411
00:28:12,858 --> 00:28:13,818
Sir?

412
00:28:14,151 --> 00:28:15,820
My daughter's name is Georgia.

413
00:28:17,196 --> 00:28:18,489
Teddy Aragon.

414
00:28:21,742 --> 00:28:23,035
La Familia.

415
00:28:23,369 --> 00:28:24,662
I'm Teddy...

416
00:28:25,496 --> 00:28:26,497
Aragon.

417
00:28:35,589 --> 00:28:37,883
Good morning to all of you.

418
00:28:39,802 --> 00:28:43,180
I know you've been hearing
a lot of news

419
00:28:43,431 --> 00:28:44,890
about La Familia.

420
00:28:45,558 --> 00:28:47,643
What do you think he'll say?

421
00:28:48,519 --> 00:28:50,354
You probably heard all of those

422
00:28:50,729 --> 00:28:52,731
because we discussed them

423
00:28:53,524 --> 00:28:56,277
at the recent
Shareholders Summit.

424
00:28:56,569 --> 00:28:58,904
It's as if we're about
to be executed.

425
00:28:58,904 --> 00:29:00,281
Don't be like that.

426
00:29:00,281 --> 00:29:01,615
And don't be nervous.

427
00:29:01,615 --> 00:29:03,742
Patricia won't abandon us.

428
00:29:03,742 --> 00:29:06,036
Why isn't Patricia there?

429
00:29:06,871 --> 00:29:09,457
A lot has happened
in La Familia.

430
00:29:09,957 --> 00:29:12,376
But change is inevitable.

431
00:29:14,044 --> 00:29:17,673
We need to go
with the flow to survive.

432
00:29:17,673 --> 00:29:18,966
So,

433
00:29:18,966 --> 00:29:21,510
as much as it breaks my heart
to tell all of you this,

434
00:29:22,428 --> 00:29:24,430
but we are going to start

435
00:29:25,347 --> 00:29:27,600
laying off employees.

436
00:29:27,600 --> 00:29:29,435
- Oh no.
- Oh no, I hope not!

437
00:29:29,435 --> 00:29:31,228
I hope they won't let me go.

438
00:29:33,522 --> 00:29:35,107
That's not going to happen!

439
00:29:40,696 --> 00:29:42,615
Patricia, you have
no business here.

440
00:29:43,115 --> 00:29:45,534
You will not be
laying any employees off!

441
00:29:46,285 --> 00:29:50,206
I will use my entire inheritance
to save them.

442
00:29:53,667 --> 00:29:55,252
We already voted on this.

443
00:29:55,252 --> 00:29:58,297
And besides,
this is what the board decided.

444
00:30:01,300 --> 00:30:03,010
Let me go!

445
00:30:03,010 --> 00:30:04,428
Don't touch me!

446
00:30:04,929 --> 00:30:08,641
But that doesn't mean
no one can oppose you anymore.

447
00:30:09,016 --> 00:30:10,559
I know what you're doing.

448
00:30:11,227 --> 00:30:15,814
You're erasing all traces
of my mother in La Familia!

449
00:30:15,814 --> 00:30:19,944
Including the employees
she protected for a long time.

450
00:30:19,944 --> 00:30:21,654
Patricia,
no matter what you say,

451
00:30:21,654 --> 00:30:23,239
there's nothing
you can do anymore.

452
00:30:26,742 --> 00:30:28,035
You are wrong!

453
00:30:30,120 --> 00:30:31,705
With my support,

454
00:30:32,498 --> 00:30:35,876
we comprise the new majority.
And I support...

455
00:30:36,502 --> 00:30:37,711
Ms. Dela Cruz.

456
00:30:42,591 --> 00:30:45,553
- We're saved!
- You heard that?

457
00:30:45,553 --> 00:30:47,179
- Yes! Yes!
- Oh my god! Oh my god!

458
00:30:49,431 --> 00:30:51,016
What's going on?!

459
00:30:51,016 --> 00:30:52,726
Tell me what's happening.

460
00:30:53,519 --> 00:30:54,520
Please.

461
00:30:54,520 --> 00:30:55,813
Johnny, tell me what--

462
00:30:55,813 --> 00:30:57,940
You used me.

463
00:31:01,110 --> 00:31:03,571
I'm only putting up
with that old man

464
00:31:03,571 --> 00:31:06,699
just to get my hands
on La Familia!

465
00:31:08,742 --> 00:31:11,245
I heard you can understand
a bit of Tagalog.

466
00:31:11,620 --> 00:31:13,706
Do you understand what
she's saying in the video?

467
00:31:18,586 --> 00:31:21,130
What lies did you tell
my husband?

468
00:31:21,130 --> 00:31:22,172
No, no, no, no.

469
00:31:22,715 --> 00:31:24,133
She didn't have to say anything.

470
00:31:24,133 --> 00:31:26,677
I watched you talking
to Ricardo.

471
00:31:26,677 --> 00:31:28,178
I heard what you said.

472
00:31:28,971 --> 00:31:31,432
How you were just putting up
with an old man

473
00:31:31,432 --> 00:31:34,101
because you wanted to get
your hands on La Familia.

474
00:31:36,061 --> 00:31:38,355
You've always been
an ungrateful brat!

475
00:31:39,398 --> 00:31:41,191
I will not let you destroy

476
00:31:41,191 --> 00:31:43,152
what my family worked
hard for ever again!

477
00:31:45,821 --> 00:31:49,325
I won't let you get
your hands on La Familia.

478
00:31:52,703 --> 00:31:54,413
"Do it now!"

479
00:31:59,376 --> 00:32:00,461
Go ahead!

480
00:32:00,961 --> 00:32:02,171
Burn it!

481
00:32:04,923 --> 00:32:06,091
Stop this.

482
00:32:08,469 --> 00:32:10,304
I will do everything

483
00:32:10,679 --> 00:32:13,641
to take back
my mother's company from you.

484
00:32:16,644 --> 00:32:17,770
Patricia,

485
00:32:19,813 --> 00:32:23,400
I am giving La Familia
a new life.

486
00:32:23,400 --> 00:32:25,194
But you...

487
00:32:25,194 --> 00:32:28,822
...you just want to protect
the things your mom did.

488
00:32:29,615 --> 00:32:30,658
Wait.

489
00:32:31,116 --> 00:32:32,493
Protect,

490
00:32:34,203 --> 00:32:35,496
or cover up?

491
00:32:35,496 --> 00:32:37,164
Stop this nonsense.

492
00:32:38,832 --> 00:32:41,877
I know why you're doing this.

493
00:32:45,881 --> 00:32:48,509
You are Cecilia Pineda's son.

494
00:32:53,222 --> 00:32:54,973
Do you think I'll deny that?

495
00:32:56,225 --> 00:32:57,351
It's true!

496
00:32:58,143 --> 00:33:00,562
I am Cecilia Pineda's son!

497
00:33:02,356 --> 00:33:04,817
The person your mother accused

498
00:33:05,401 --> 00:33:07,403
of burning down La Familia!

499
00:33:07,778 --> 00:33:10,823
The person whose name
and dignity you destroyed!

500
00:33:11,490 --> 00:33:12,574
For what?!

501
00:33:13,033 --> 00:33:15,369
To cover up your faults!

502
00:33:18,122 --> 00:33:21,709
It's time for me
to avenge my mother.

503
00:33:25,754 --> 00:33:27,840
Flames
are currently consuming

504
00:33:27,840 --> 00:33:31,969
all the factories
of La Familia Bottling Company!

505
00:33:31,969 --> 00:33:34,138
Workers were startled

506
00:33:34,138 --> 00:33:37,433
when explosions suddenly
erupted and fire broke out

507
00:33:37,433 --> 00:33:39,852
inside and outside the buildings

508
00:33:39,852 --> 00:33:42,813
prompting them to evacuate
the areas immediately.

509
00:33:42,813 --> 00:33:45,315
According
to initial investigations,

510
00:33:45,315 --> 00:33:47,985
the fire may have been
intentional.

511
00:33:48,402 --> 00:33:51,321
However, authorities are baffled

512
00:33:51,321 --> 00:33:53,657
as to who or what group

513
00:33:53,657 --> 00:33:56,702
is behind the series
of incidents.

514
00:33:57,828 --> 00:34:00,748
Another powerful explosion

515
00:34:00,748 --> 00:34:03,375
rocked yet another
La Familia factory.

516
00:34:03,709 --> 00:34:06,170
Ricardo, do you think
what you're doing

517
00:34:06,170 --> 00:34:08,422
is bringing justice
to your mother?!

518
00:34:08,422 --> 00:34:09,465
Yes!

519
00:34:13,260 --> 00:34:15,554
And I'm just getting started.

520
00:34:16,847 --> 00:34:20,809
Watch how I completely
bring La Familia down,

521
00:34:21,560 --> 00:34:25,481
the company your mother
sold her soul to.

522
00:34:28,025 --> 00:34:29,151
Enough.

523
00:34:32,112 --> 00:34:34,615
We already found Uncle Teddy.

524
00:34:35,199 --> 00:34:37,659
He already gave
his testimony to the police.

525
00:34:37,659 --> 00:34:40,287
The police will be
arriving here soon, too.

526
00:34:42,456 --> 00:34:43,707
Well, in that case,

527
00:34:45,167 --> 00:34:46,376
Patricia,

528
00:34:47,336 --> 00:34:50,047
everyone needs
to know the truth.

529
00:34:53,175 --> 00:34:55,344
It was your fault, Patricia!

530
00:34:56,053 --> 00:34:58,347
My mother's
blood is on your hands!

531
00:34:59,556 --> 00:35:03,644
Because you were the one
who burned down La Familia!

532
00:35:09,358 --> 00:35:12,611
I was the investigator
at the fire at La Familia.

533
00:35:13,070 --> 00:35:16,156
I was paid
by Diana Aragon's staff

534
00:35:16,156 --> 00:35:19,576
to cover up
for her daughter, Patricia.

535
00:35:19,910 --> 00:35:21,495
Because she was the one

536
00:35:21,495 --> 00:35:23,539
who caused
the factory fire back then.

537
00:35:23,539 --> 00:35:24,540
Patricia.

538
00:35:25,624 --> 00:35:27,501
Enzo, you should be
with Patricia.

539
00:35:27,751 --> 00:35:29,044
She needs you.

540
00:35:29,419 --> 00:35:30,712
I'll take care of Dad.

541
00:35:31,088 --> 00:35:32,089
Okay.

542
00:35:32,422 --> 00:35:35,342
Sir, you need to send units
to the office.

543
00:35:35,342 --> 00:35:36,885
- Yes, sir.
- Now. Hurry!

544
00:35:48,772 --> 00:35:49,898
Let me go!

545
00:35:53,360 --> 00:35:54,611
It wasn't me!

546
00:35:55,612 --> 00:35:58,156
I didn't burn down La Familia!

547
00:35:59,324 --> 00:36:02,703
I wasn't the only one at the
factory when the fire happened,

548
00:36:02,703 --> 00:36:04,872
Mama Carlota was there, too!

549
00:36:06,415 --> 00:36:07,583
Patricia.

550
00:36:08,709 --> 00:36:11,336
Are you looking
for someone else to blame?

551
00:36:12,379 --> 00:36:13,505
Huh?!

552
00:36:13,505 --> 00:36:18,760
I don't know
what you're talking about!

553
00:36:18,760 --> 00:36:20,053
- Enough!
- Pa!

554
00:36:20,053 --> 00:36:21,179
That's enough!

555
00:36:21,930 --> 00:36:23,015
Martin.

556
00:36:23,682 --> 00:36:26,184
You need to know
the truth, Ricardo.

557
00:36:26,685 --> 00:36:28,478
Martin, please stop.

558
00:36:28,854 --> 00:36:30,230
Did your mother say

559
00:36:30,898 --> 00:36:32,608
what we did back then?

560
00:36:33,150 --> 00:36:34,985
- Martin!
- Me,

561
00:36:35,652 --> 00:36:39,740
Cecilia, and Carlota,
we all conspired

562
00:36:40,365 --> 00:36:42,117
to steal from La Familia.

563
00:36:48,665 --> 00:36:50,834
Are you really
that desperate, Martin?

564
00:36:51,793 --> 00:36:53,045
That's the truth.

565
00:36:53,503 --> 00:36:55,547
Cecilia was our accomplice.

566
00:36:56,965 --> 00:36:58,508
Because back then, we felt like

567
00:36:58,508 --> 00:37:00,469
Don Lucio was depriving us
of what we deserved.

568
00:37:01,470 --> 00:37:04,723
Cecilia was consumed by anger.

569
00:37:04,723 --> 00:37:06,224
That's why we stole.

570
00:37:06,683 --> 00:37:08,226
We wanted revenge.

571
00:37:08,226 --> 00:37:10,228
Your mother is at fault, too!

572
00:37:10,479 --> 00:37:13,065
Martin, that's enough!

573
00:37:13,065 --> 00:37:14,983
That's enough, please!

574
00:37:15,400 --> 00:37:19,321
Carlota,
we can't hide the truth!

575
00:37:19,905 --> 00:37:21,031
Not anymore!

576
00:37:22,115 --> 00:37:23,200
No.

577
00:37:23,867 --> 00:37:28,455
I am innocent. I am innocent!

578
00:37:29,122 --> 00:37:30,374
It's Diana!

579
00:37:30,791 --> 00:37:33,627
Diana is the one
to blame for all of this!

580
00:37:33,627 --> 00:37:36,797
Don't you ever blame my mom
for something you've done!

581
00:37:36,797 --> 00:37:43,220
Your mother did nothing
but take everything from me!

582
00:37:46,139 --> 00:37:47,766
You told me back then

583
00:37:49,267 --> 00:37:51,645
that our secret
couldn't get out.

584
00:37:54,356 --> 00:37:55,482
Every time I asked you

585
00:37:55,482 --> 00:37:57,359
about what happened
in the fire,

586
00:37:57,818 --> 00:37:58,819
you avoided it.

587
00:37:59,152 --> 00:38:00,570
What do you really know?

588
00:38:01,113 --> 00:38:02,280
Tell me!

589
00:38:03,407 --> 00:38:05,075
- Tell me what you know!
- No! No!

590
00:38:05,367 --> 00:38:06,451
I don't know anything!

591
00:38:06,451 --> 00:38:07,786
Confess, Carlota!

592
00:38:14,501 --> 00:38:17,087
Yes, I was at the factory!

593
00:38:17,462 --> 00:38:19,548
- I was there.
- What did you do there?!

594
00:38:27,472 --> 00:38:31,476
Cecilia was also part
of the plan.

595
00:38:35,439 --> 00:38:38,358
Martin, I did all of that...

596
00:38:38,984 --> 00:38:43,071
so no one would find out
what we did.

597
00:38:43,071 --> 00:38:45,240
I saved you.

598
00:38:45,240 --> 00:38:50,620
I saved you
because I love you so much.

599
00:38:57,919 --> 00:38:59,713
What are you two doing, huh?

600
00:39:03,383 --> 00:39:06,261
Do you think you can get away

601
00:39:06,261 --> 00:39:10,807
with the theft that you've done?

602
00:39:10,807 --> 00:39:13,810
I've suspected you two
for a long time.

603
00:39:14,394 --> 00:39:15,645
You thieves!

604
00:39:16,313 --> 00:39:19,483
Who's the real thief here,
Lucio?

605
00:39:19,483 --> 00:39:21,359
You're the one enjoying

606
00:39:21,359 --> 00:39:23,320
everything I've worked
so hard for.

607
00:39:23,779 --> 00:39:26,865
Why? What are you
so proud of, huh?

608
00:39:27,240 --> 00:39:28,742
Your recipe?

609
00:39:28,742 --> 00:39:31,369
Do you think
we didn't change it?

610
00:39:31,787 --> 00:39:33,622
That was my idea!

611
00:39:37,417 --> 00:39:39,252
You're just my employee!

612
00:39:39,669 --> 00:39:41,129
Have you ever wondered

613
00:39:41,129 --> 00:39:44,341
why you never got anywhere
in this company?

614
00:39:44,841 --> 00:39:46,301
Why you were fired?

615
00:39:46,301 --> 00:39:48,804
Because you're crazy!

616
00:39:48,804 --> 00:39:51,389
We all saw that you weren't
in your right mind!

617
00:39:51,389 --> 00:39:52,766
That's not true!

618
00:39:52,766 --> 00:39:54,643
You're so cruel!

619
00:39:54,643 --> 00:39:56,353
And you,
you're no better, huh?

620
00:39:56,353 --> 00:39:57,604
You've got some nerve!

621
00:39:57,604 --> 00:40:00,982
After everything my family
has done for you,

622
00:40:02,234 --> 00:40:05,153
this is how you repay us?

623
00:40:05,153 --> 00:40:08,615
I didn't even intend
to help you back then.

624
00:40:09,199 --> 00:40:11,576
Diana was just the one
who felt sorry for you.

625
00:40:12,744 --> 00:40:14,287
The truth of the matter is...

626
00:40:15,080 --> 00:40:18,542
you're nothing special.

627
00:40:19,126 --> 00:40:20,669
You're the child of a servant.

628
00:40:21,628 --> 00:40:24,381
You'll be a servant
for the rest of your life.

629
00:40:25,132 --> 00:40:26,216
What did you say?

630
00:40:26,216 --> 00:40:27,634
Isn't it true?

631
00:40:27,634 --> 00:40:30,762
I can clearly see how jealous
you are of my daughter.

632
00:40:31,221 --> 00:40:36,017
And you even lust
after her husband.

633
00:40:36,017 --> 00:40:37,894
Speaking of which,
where's Martin?

634
00:40:37,894 --> 00:40:39,980
Wasn't he supposed
to be part of your plan?

635
00:40:39,980 --> 00:40:42,190
Martin has nothing
to do with this.

636
00:40:42,190 --> 00:40:44,067
I know you're in cahoots!

637
00:40:44,067 --> 00:40:47,070
Hey! You're nothing
but a dog in my eyes.

638
00:40:47,070 --> 00:40:50,073
I feed you and give you
a place to stay.

639
00:40:50,740 --> 00:40:53,326
But I know that one day,

640
00:40:53,827 --> 00:40:56,371
you'll turn on me, too.

641
00:40:56,371 --> 00:40:58,623
Because no matter what happens,

642
00:40:58,623 --> 00:41:02,586
you know you'll never even
come close to being as good

643
00:41:02,586 --> 00:41:03,920
as my daughter!

644
00:41:04,337 --> 00:41:06,423
You damn old man!

645
00:41:08,550 --> 00:41:10,093
- You monster!
- Stop it!

646
00:41:10,093 --> 00:41:11,553
Let go of me!

647
00:41:11,553 --> 00:41:13,096
You let go of me!

648
00:41:13,096 --> 00:41:14,264
You beast!

649
00:41:19,561 --> 00:41:22,230
Come on!
We can't be seen here!

650
00:41:32,407 --> 00:41:34,367
Do you intend
to kill me, huh?!

651
00:41:35,327 --> 00:41:36,745
You witch!

652
00:41:40,832 --> 00:41:42,542
You always say...

653
00:41:43,126 --> 00:41:46,046
that I used you
to replace Diana.

654
00:41:46,046 --> 00:41:47,130
But the truth is...

655
00:41:48,423 --> 00:41:50,550
...you used me!

656
00:41:51,885 --> 00:41:54,804
Just so you could say
you defeated Diana!

657
00:42:00,352 --> 00:42:02,896
My grandpa died in that fire!

658
00:42:03,313 --> 00:42:05,774
My relationship
with my mother fell apart

659
00:42:05,774 --> 00:42:07,108
because of that fire!

660
00:42:07,108 --> 00:42:08,360
What?!

661
00:42:09,861 --> 00:42:11,238
We all suffered

662
00:42:11,238 --> 00:42:13,240
while you stood by
and did nothing!

663
00:42:14,616 --> 00:42:16,701
How could you live with
yourself after doing that?!

664
00:42:16,701 --> 00:42:21,456
You let me blame myself
for my grandfather's death!

665
00:42:21,456 --> 00:42:25,794
You let us believe that it was
other people's fault!

666
00:42:25,794 --> 00:42:27,921
That it was Cecilia's fault!

667
00:42:28,964 --> 00:42:30,548
Huh?!

668
00:42:39,766 --> 00:42:41,685
- You bitch!
- No!

669
00:42:41,685 --> 00:42:43,770
Hey!

670
00:42:43,770 --> 00:42:45,689
You left my mother!

671
00:42:47,148 --> 00:42:49,943
It wouldn't have happened
to her if it weren't for you!

672
00:42:49,943 --> 00:42:52,404
Ricardo, no!

673
00:43:06,251 --> 00:43:08,253
I knew it. You're a traitor.

674
00:43:11,673 --> 00:43:12,674
Go on!

675
00:43:15,010 --> 00:43:16,386
Come here.

676
00:43:16,803 --> 00:43:19,139
Huh? What if I kill
your daughter first?

677
00:43:19,139 --> 00:43:20,807
No!

678
00:43:21,808 --> 00:43:23,143
That's enough, Ricardo!

679
00:43:23,435 --> 00:43:25,186
Face the consequences of
everything you've done!

680
00:43:26,813 --> 00:43:29,149
You think I'm going to let

681
00:43:30,191 --> 00:43:32,527
everything I've done
go to waste?!

682
00:43:32,527 --> 00:43:35,822
And with what my mother
went through?

683
00:43:36,323 --> 00:43:37,949
I'll make you pay!

684
00:43:38,533 --> 00:43:40,160
Enzo!

685
00:43:43,038 --> 00:43:44,789
That's enough, Ricardo!

686
00:43:53,882 --> 00:43:55,759
Don't drag them into this!

687
00:43:56,259 --> 00:43:58,053
I'm the one you need, right?

688
00:43:58,386 --> 00:43:59,804
I'm here!

689
00:44:04,768 --> 00:44:06,394
How did you survive?

690
00:44:37,217 --> 00:44:38,259
Hello?

691
00:44:38,259 --> 00:44:41,054
Is this Patricia Dela Cruz?

692
00:44:41,054 --> 00:44:42,639
Yes. Who is this?

693
00:44:42,639 --> 00:44:45,225
This is about Diana Aragon.

694
00:44:45,767 --> 00:44:47,310
She asked me to call you.

695
00:44:51,356 --> 00:44:54,526
Ma!

696
00:44:54,526 --> 00:44:55,610
My dear.

697
00:44:57,946 --> 00:45:01,449
Mama is okay. It's okay.

698
00:45:02,158 --> 00:45:03,868
Patricia...

699
00:45:03,868 --> 00:45:08,164
I'm so sorry I didn't listen
to you before.

700
00:45:10,500 --> 00:45:14,421
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

701
00:45:20,301 --> 00:45:23,304
What's important is that
you're safe, Mama.

702
00:45:25,348 --> 00:45:26,933
Doc, what happened?

703
00:45:26,933 --> 00:45:29,352
She has a stab wound
on her chest.

704
00:45:29,352 --> 00:45:33,731
Luckily, it hit her sternum
instead of her heart.

705
00:45:33,731 --> 00:45:36,192
It is a bone in the middle
of the chest.

706
00:45:36,192 --> 00:45:39,696
If the stab went any deeper,

707
00:45:40,613 --> 00:45:42,866
she might not have survived.

708
00:45:42,866 --> 00:45:44,117
Excuse me.

709
00:45:45,452 --> 00:45:48,872
That Ricardo is an animal!

710
00:45:53,501 --> 00:45:55,795
Wh-what about T-Teddy?

711
00:45:55,795 --> 00:45:57,589
Is he already with you?

712
00:45:57,797 --> 00:46:00,925
Mama, we still don't know
where Uncle Teddy is.

713
00:46:01,551 --> 00:46:03,595
I'm sure...

714
00:46:03,595 --> 00:46:05,680
Ricardo has him.

715
00:46:05,930 --> 00:46:08,808
Miss D, we need to report this
to the police.

716
00:46:08,808 --> 00:46:09,976
Nope.

717
00:46:09,976 --> 00:46:13,605
We need to make sure that
my brother is safe first.

718
00:46:14,564 --> 00:46:17,025
Ricardo is a dangerous man.

719
00:46:18,318 --> 00:46:21,237
He planned all of this.

720
00:46:21,905 --> 00:46:27,076
That's why we need
to carefully plan everything

721
00:46:27,076 --> 00:46:28,495
against him, too.

722
00:46:29,621 --> 00:46:31,956
If he finds out
I'm still alive,

723
00:46:31,956 --> 00:46:36,461
I'm sure he'll hurt Teddy.

724
00:46:36,461 --> 00:46:37,879
What's your plan?

725
00:46:37,879 --> 00:46:43,968
Ricardo needs to completely
believe that I'm dead.

726
00:46:45,970 --> 00:46:48,681
I've already made
arrangements at the morgue.

727
00:46:49,057 --> 00:46:51,768
I also have an agreement
with the staff there.

728
00:46:51,768 --> 00:46:54,229
So just collect the ashes,

729
00:46:54,229 --> 00:46:56,814
then go straight
to the columbarium.

730
00:46:56,814 --> 00:46:58,733
I need to get
to the columbarium first

731
00:46:59,150 --> 00:47:01,194
so Sir Ricardo won't be able
to do anything.

732
00:47:01,194 --> 00:47:03,780
I'll get justice
for what he did to you.

733
00:47:04,989 --> 00:47:08,576
Ask Enzo for Albert Meneses's
contact number.

734
00:47:08,576 --> 00:47:10,995
- Who is he?
- He's a good friend.

735
00:47:10,995 --> 00:47:13,081
He's also part of La Familia.

736
00:47:13,081 --> 00:47:14,415
He can help you, dear.

737
00:47:14,415 --> 00:47:15,750
I have a meeting
with Mr. Meneses.

738
00:47:15,750 --> 00:47:16,834
Why isn't he here yet?

739
00:47:16,834 --> 00:47:19,087
He has another meeting
to attend.

740
00:47:19,087 --> 00:47:20,421
Who is it with?

741
00:47:20,421 --> 00:47:22,382
With Patricia Dela Cruz.

742
00:47:22,674 --> 00:47:23,675
Our new president...

743
00:47:24,259 --> 00:47:27,387
Mr. Ricardo Salvador!

744
00:47:27,387 --> 00:47:29,264
I know
what he's up to.

745
00:47:29,264 --> 00:47:30,765
I won't let him
get away with it.

746
00:47:30,765 --> 00:47:32,475
I'll challenge
the board's decision.

747
00:47:32,475 --> 00:47:33,977
Oh, no, no, no.

748
00:47:34,435 --> 00:47:35,728
Going up against the board

749
00:47:35,728 --> 00:47:37,689
will only make
you look desperate.

750
00:47:38,147 --> 00:47:41,317
Let Ricardo enjoy
his little victory.

751
00:47:41,901 --> 00:47:44,696
We play smart, not loud.

752
00:47:45,572 --> 00:47:48,324
Act like you've accepted defeat.

753
00:47:48,908 --> 00:47:50,785
To lower his guard down.

754
00:47:50,785 --> 00:47:51,995
And then,

755
00:47:51,995 --> 00:47:53,496
we hit him

756
00:47:53,997 --> 00:47:55,456
once he feels comfortable.

757
00:47:57,625 --> 00:48:00,587
Timing is everything.

758
00:48:02,547 --> 00:48:05,008
I saw the sleeping pills
in your room.

759
00:48:05,008 --> 00:48:06,759
Ricardo gave them to me.

760
00:48:07,051 --> 00:48:09,137
And ever since he came
into my life,

761
00:48:09,679 --> 00:48:12,098
he was monitoring
my every move.

762
00:48:12,515 --> 00:48:13,975
I'll use this against him.

763
00:48:14,392 --> 00:48:15,893
What do you mean?

764
00:48:16,227 --> 00:48:19,188
I'll make him suffer
for everything he's done to you.

765
00:48:19,814 --> 00:48:20,857
Patricia...

766
00:48:22,650 --> 00:48:24,110
I'll take care of that.

767
00:48:24,777 --> 00:48:25,945
Miss D,

768
00:48:25,945 --> 00:48:27,780
we've done
what you asked us to do.

769
00:48:28,072 --> 00:48:29,532
Good job, Oliver.

770
00:48:29,532 --> 00:48:32,160
I'll tell you when
to make your move.

771
00:48:32,160 --> 00:48:33,745
Be careful.

772
00:48:33,745 --> 00:48:36,414
Thank you, Director.
I mean, Miss D.

773
00:48:36,873 --> 00:48:37,999
Alright.

774
00:48:50,637 --> 00:48:52,513
I knew it.

775
00:48:53,139 --> 00:48:54,557
You're alive.

776
00:48:55,308 --> 00:48:57,518
Are you and your daughter
making a fool of me?

777
00:48:57,518 --> 00:48:58,645
Ma.

778
00:48:58,645 --> 00:49:00,271
Mama...

779
00:49:00,271 --> 00:49:02,106
But I shouldn't be surprised.

780
00:49:03,149 --> 00:49:06,027
You're one tough weed
to get rid of, Diana.

781
00:49:06,027 --> 00:49:10,490
If there's anyone
who's the best at lying,

782
00:49:10,865 --> 00:49:12,241
it's you!

783
00:49:15,370 --> 00:49:16,829
You'll do anything

784
00:49:17,789 --> 00:49:20,083
to hide the truth

785
00:49:21,501 --> 00:49:25,046
just to save yourself!

786
00:49:25,046 --> 00:49:27,882
Mama never wanted
to hurt Cecilia!

787
00:49:27,882 --> 00:49:29,217
What do you mean, she didn't?!

788
00:49:31,010 --> 00:49:33,971
She stole my mother's hard work!

789
00:49:34,347 --> 00:49:35,765
That's not true!

790
00:49:35,765 --> 00:49:37,308
That's not true.

791
00:49:37,308 --> 00:49:38,518
Liar!

792
00:49:40,019 --> 00:49:42,313
If my mother did anything,

793
00:49:44,357 --> 00:49:47,985
it was because of the greed
of you and your father.

794
00:49:49,737 --> 00:49:54,117
You denied her
of what was rightfully hers!

795
00:49:54,117 --> 00:49:55,159
Ricardo.

796
00:49:56,035 --> 00:49:57,829
Everything you said

797
00:49:58,579 --> 00:50:00,665
isn't true.

798
00:50:01,207 --> 00:50:02,458
But it's true.

799
00:50:02,458 --> 00:50:06,003
It's true that I wronged
Cecilia terribly.

800
00:50:07,004 --> 00:50:08,005
Ricardo.

801
00:50:09,841 --> 00:50:12,301
We can't spend the rest
of our lives trapped

802
00:50:12,301 --> 00:50:14,637
in the pain of the past.

803
00:50:15,638 --> 00:50:19,434
I know I can't undo
what I've done.

804
00:50:20,268 --> 00:50:23,479
But I want you to hear it
directly from me.

805
00:50:26,607 --> 00:50:28,025
I'm sorry.

806
00:50:28,776 --> 00:50:30,987
Please forgive me.

807
00:50:31,612 --> 00:50:33,948
Please forgive me.

808
00:50:33,948 --> 00:50:36,200
Please forgive me!

809
00:50:44,125 --> 00:50:45,585
Kneel in front of me.

810
00:50:46,127 --> 00:50:50,047
Mama, Mama...

811
00:50:50,047 --> 00:50:51,257
Ricardo...

812
00:50:53,509 --> 00:50:56,137
you don't have to drag them
into this mess anymore.

813
00:50:57,013 --> 00:51:02,226
All this pain and rage
needs to end with the two of us.

814
00:51:02,226 --> 00:51:05,396
Because I refuse
to let my daughter

815
00:51:05,396 --> 00:51:07,815
inherit and carry it with her.

816
00:51:07,815 --> 00:51:09,442
Kneel!

817
00:51:20,995 --> 00:51:22,121
Stop!

818
00:51:22,121 --> 00:51:23,331
Enzo!

819
00:51:24,957 --> 00:51:26,459
Enzo!

820
00:51:26,918 --> 00:51:28,336
Martin!

821
00:51:29,712 --> 00:51:31,297
- Papa!
- Martin!

822
00:51:33,049 --> 00:51:35,218
Ricardo, please stop!
That's enough.

823
00:51:35,218 --> 00:51:37,136
I'm begging you please.

824
00:51:37,136 --> 00:51:38,763
Stop it, Ricardo!

825
00:51:40,306 --> 00:51:42,642
Ri-- Ricardo, not my daughter.

826
00:51:45,436 --> 00:51:47,563
No!

827
00:52:11,546 --> 00:52:13,172
Watch closely, Diana.

828
00:52:44,287 --> 00:52:45,496
Ricardo!

829
00:53:23,951 --> 00:53:25,411
Mama...

830
00:53:45,431 --> 00:53:46,432
Dad!

831
00:53:47,433 --> 00:53:49,435
Daddy? Dad?

832
00:53:49,936 --> 00:53:52,688
Daddy, wake up! Help! Help!

833
00:53:53,189 --> 00:53:54,357
Dad!

834
00:54:09,121 --> 00:54:11,707
They say
that in every four seconds,

835
00:54:11,707 --> 00:54:14,168
a child is born into the world.

836
00:54:14,585 --> 00:54:17,463
And every time a child is born,

837
00:54:18,005 --> 00:54:20,591
a mother emerges.

838
00:54:22,885 --> 00:54:23,928
How's Diana?

839
00:54:23,928 --> 00:54:25,596
She's still inside
with Patricia.

840
00:54:25,596 --> 00:54:26,973
Scalpel.

841
00:54:31,060 --> 00:54:32,895
Diana...

842
00:54:34,814 --> 00:54:36,524
I'm sorry.

843
00:54:39,986 --> 00:54:41,946
I'm sorry, Diana!

844
00:54:44,782 --> 00:54:49,787
And with every birth,
a mother's world changes.

845
00:54:50,121 --> 00:54:51,956
When she gives birth,

846
00:54:51,956 --> 00:54:54,375
she no longer holds
her own life.

847
00:54:54,375 --> 00:54:57,336
She now lives for her child.

848
00:55:02,842 --> 00:55:05,970
But some mothers have wounds

849
00:55:05,970 --> 00:55:08,347
that can't be seen
on the outside.

850
00:55:08,931 --> 00:55:12,018
Still, they fight through
the pain that they carry,

851
00:55:12,018 --> 00:55:13,310
no matter what it is.

852
00:55:18,357 --> 00:55:20,401
I'll take good care of our kids.

853
00:55:29,869 --> 00:55:32,288
With every life she carries,

854
00:55:32,288 --> 00:55:34,040
another life is on the line.

855
00:55:36,083 --> 00:55:40,504
That's why she'll do everything
because her child's life

856
00:55:40,504 --> 00:55:42,631
depends on her.

857
00:55:48,429 --> 00:55:50,806
Mothers make mistakes.

858
00:55:51,640 --> 00:55:56,187
But that same love
also guides the child

859
00:55:56,187 --> 00:55:58,439
to find it in their heart
to forgive.

860
00:55:58,773 --> 00:56:01,442
Patricia and I were
separated for so many years.

861
00:56:01,817 --> 00:56:05,071
But fate had other plans and...

862
00:56:05,071 --> 00:56:06,947
brought us back together.

863
00:56:08,616 --> 00:56:10,409
When we got together,

864
00:56:11,035 --> 00:56:14,246
I thought, it was my chance

865
00:56:14,622 --> 00:56:18,834
to do my duty to protect her.

866
00:56:19,251 --> 00:56:21,712
And so, every time
she would fall down,

867
00:56:22,671 --> 00:56:24,465
I wanted to be there
to catch her.

868
00:56:24,924 --> 00:56:27,551
Every time she would lose,

869
00:56:28,094 --> 00:56:29,470
I wanted to fight for her.

870
00:56:30,763 --> 00:56:32,473
But I realized,

871
00:56:34,225 --> 00:56:36,560
I could never make up

872
00:56:37,269 --> 00:56:40,439
for lost time.

873
00:56:41,690 --> 00:56:43,359
But still, I saw

874
00:56:45,027 --> 00:56:47,488
how she learned

875
00:56:49,448 --> 00:56:51,659
to fight for herself.

876
00:56:53,077 --> 00:56:57,123
And that's where I saw her
as more than just a daughter,

877
00:56:57,331 --> 00:56:59,583
but also as a woman

878
00:57:00,042 --> 00:57:02,503
who knows
how to stand her ground.

879
00:57:03,129 --> 00:57:06,632
A woman who knows
how to stand back up

880
00:57:07,091 --> 00:57:09,176
even without anyone there
to catch her.

881
00:57:11,971 --> 00:57:13,556
So now...

882
00:57:14,765 --> 00:57:16,142
I'm ready.

883
00:57:17,434 --> 00:57:19,520
With all my heart,

884
00:57:20,312 --> 00:57:22,773
I give her to you.

885
00:57:28,487 --> 00:57:29,864
And give her

886
00:57:32,116 --> 00:57:34,743
the company that was built,

887
00:57:35,619 --> 00:57:36,912
nurtured,

888
00:57:38,372 --> 00:57:41,876
and loved by the Aragon family.

889
00:57:46,380 --> 00:57:47,840
La Familia,

890
00:57:48,591 --> 00:57:50,426
from this day on,

891
00:57:52,136 --> 00:57:54,263
please welcome your new CEO.

892
00:57:54,847 --> 00:57:57,975
Patricia Aragon Dela Cruz.

893
00:58:26,295 --> 00:58:28,297
I love you, my dear.

894
00:58:28,297 --> 00:58:30,090
We will start again.

895
00:58:30,966 --> 00:58:34,887
We will build a new La Familia.

896
00:58:35,596 --> 00:58:37,514
I'm very proud of you.

897
00:58:37,514 --> 00:58:40,559
- I love you.
- I love you, Mama.

898
00:58:40,559 --> 00:58:41,560
I love you.

899
00:59:06,585 --> 00:59:07,753
Mama.
